      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764603588000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Sarah. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764603598333333
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 60992,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764603602933333
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. To start, could you tell me a little more about the item? What specifically is the issue?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764603604933333
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a jersey. It's the wrong size.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 60992,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764603613199999
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I understand. And is it a technical fault with the jersey, or more of a preference issue with the fit?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764603615733332
    },
    {
      "text": "It's just too tight. I don't know what you call it. It doesn't fit.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 60992,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764603623133332
    },
    {
      "text": "Not a problem at all. We can definitely look into that for you. Do you happen to have your order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764603627799998
    },
    {
      "text": "Ugh, hold on. Yeah, it's VF8675309. I've had it for a bit, so we'll see if you can even do anything.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 60992,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764603635333331
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. Let me pull that up... VF8675309. I see the order was delivered about 79 days ago. One moment while I confirm our policy for that item.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764603642199997
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I have good news. That jersey is a standard item, and it falls within our 90-day return policy. We can absolutely process an exchange for a larger size or a full refund for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764603652133330
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. An exchange, I guess.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 60992,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764603664533330
    },
    {
